title: "Atlas of Extra Gravitation"
abstract: "An open, theory-neutral atlas of the acceleration discrepancy: where and how the observed gravitational acceleration exceeds what Newtonian gravity predicts from detected baryonic matter, from star clusters to galaxy clusters."
